# Modular Enterprise IAM Provider in C#

Below is a comprehensive design for a modular Enterprise Identity and Access Management (IAM) system in C# with the three requested components. This implementation uses modern .NET patterns and follows security best practices.

## Architecture Overview

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                 Enterprise IAM Provider               │
├───────────────┬───────────────────┬───────────────────┤
│  OpenID Connect│   User Directory   │  Token Revocation │
│   Authorization │     Service       │     Subsystem     │
└───────────────┴───────────────────┴───────────────────┘
```

## 1. Core Interfaces and Models

```csharp
// Common interfaces
